{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t日本靜岡縣一間商店有野豬闖入，造成七人受傷。野豬已被捕殺。<br/>\n<br/>\n共同社引述當地警方和消防部門指，靜岡市一間商店昨日報警，指一頭野豬撞破玻璃闖入，有人被咬傷。<br/>\n<br/>\n七名傷者都沒有無生命危險。<br/>\n<br/>\n參與捕殺行動的狩獵協會成員稱，涉事野豬重約100至120公斤。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：方潤南\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:34:39.780211+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T05:51:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T06:28:17.107473+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T06:28:17.107473+00:00","content_hash":"dad620fbcf8613be94139abf06a6d62a644d1709c2a457bdaf380d5a20248f9f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}